<div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl w-full bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-white/20">
    
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-wider text-white mb-2">Your Data is Yours.</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-8">No ads. No selling. No "Big Brother."</p>
    
    <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6">
      <p class="italic text-slate-500 text-sm">Last Updated: January 23, 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6">Our Promise</h2>
      <p>
        We built Memflect because we needed a safe space for our own thoughts. We believe your memories and voice are sacred. 
        Unlike "Big Tech" platforms, <strong>we do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data</strong> for ad revenue. You are the customer, not the product.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6">Your Voice & Reflections</h2>
      <p>
        We collect your voice recordings solely to generate your personal reflection audio. 
        We do not use your private voice data to train public AI models that mimic human speech. 
        Your voice stays within your private reflection loop.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6">Private by Default</h2>
      <p>
        Your recordings are encrypted in storage. We have designed the system so that your reflections are yours alone. 
        If you delete a memory, it is gone from our servers forever.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6">Talk to a Human</h2>
      <p>
        Memflect is built by a real person, not a faceless corporation. If you have concerns, email me directly: 
        <a href="mailto:ryan@memflect.com" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">ryan@memflect.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
      <%= link_to "← Back to Home", root_path, class: "text-sky-400 hover:underline" %>
    </div>
